# CatDex — Supabase

## Client

- `src/lib/supabase.ts` — `EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL`, `EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`
- If unset: mock/local auth paths may run — surface that clearly in UI banners

## Responsibilities

| Concern | Where |
|---------|--------|
| Auth session | `useAuthStore` + Supabase auth |
| Profiles | `profiles` table |
| Cats / sightings / analysis | schema + `catSync` / queries |
| Photos | Storage bucket `cats` |
| Analyze auth | Server verifies Supabase JWT |

## Rules

- Use **anon key** only in the app; **service role** only on server
- Never disable RLS in production schemas without a migration review
- Prefer parameterized client helpers already in `supabaseQueries` / `catSync`
- Account deletion and privileged ops go through server routes with service role

## Schema source

- `supabase/schema.sql` + `supabase/migrations/`
- Follow `22-database-schema.mdc` when changing tables
